**Final line:** Noise-gated banked plan verdicts (chain7 wisdom, adaptive playoffs, provisional expiry) over bit-identical r8 kernels — wallaby B=1 30.0 µs / batched 24.5 µs at L=25 (33.6/306/2990 at 27/50/100 graded), single-call rel L2 3.6e-16, graded-chain 3.06e-14 (tol 1e-10).
